<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1002T_S000D" variety="S000D">
<name>Other Electrical</name>
<ttl id="1002T_S000D_746SZ_T00DB" variety="T00DB">
<name>Hands-free System</name>
<para id="RM000001C4000HX" category="D" type-id="3001B" name-id="7326C-00" from="200612" to="200912">
<name>How to Proceed with Troubleshooting</name>
<subpara id="RM000001C4000HX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___0000B4D00000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<descript-diag>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Vehicle brought to workshop</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001C4100HX"/>)</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>The hands-free system provides services using communication. Therefore, it is important to determine whether the problem is caused by the communication system, including radio wave conditions, or by something else. Perform thorough customer problem analysis according to the questionnaire, and ask about the conditions of occurrence carefully to determine whether the problem may be temporary due to poor radio wave conditions.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If conditions such as being unable to make hands-free calls occur temporarily, this is due to radio wave conditions or base station congestion and is not a malfunction. (Explain to the customer and have them continue using it)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test2>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Occurrence of a constant malfunction</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<results>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Service Inspection</testtitle>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For details of the procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep02" href="RM0000002RV02BX"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>AVC-LAN Connection Check</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Start diagnosis.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>On the service inspection screen, check that all connected devices are displayed.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.25in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="0.88in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Part Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Device Name</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Navigation Receiver Assembly</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>AVN</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Toll Collection (ETC) Computer Assembly (w/ ETC)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ETC</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Television camera controller (w/ intelligent parking assist system)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>CAMERA-C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check DTC</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Record the DTCs.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Perform inspection and repair according to the instructions in the Diagnostic Trouble Code Chart.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.25in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.88in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Device Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Reference</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>AVN</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>
<xref label="Seep03" href="RM0000002RS03EX"/>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ETC (w/ ETC)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>
<xref label="Seep04" href="RM000001US9001X"/>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>CAMERA-C (w/ intelligent parking assist system)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>
<xref label="Seep12" href="RM0000002O401AX"/>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear DTC</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck DTC</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Based on the recorded DTCs, reproduce the problem symptom and check whether the DTCs are output again.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No code, symptom can be confirmed and reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No code, symptom cannot be confirmed and reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Code output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>All connected devices other than AVN are not displayed</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>All connected devices other than AVN are displayed as "Not Connected"</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>D</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to Symptom Simulation (see <xref label="Seep13" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result>C</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 6</action-ci-right>
<result>D</result>
<action-ci-right>Troubleshooting Flowchart AVC-LAN Malfunction (see <xref label="Seep11" href="RM0000007EM02GX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>List by Symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Problem Symptoms Table (see <xref label="Seep05" href="RM000001C4400HX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Not listed in List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Corresponds to List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 6</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Perform troubleshooting using the following methods based on the problem symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Diagnosis System (see <xref label="Seep06" href="RM000001C4800HX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Terminals of ECU (see <xref label="Seep07" href="RM000001C4300HX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Adjust, Repair or Replace</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Work after Replacement</testtitle>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When replacing the navigation receiver assembly on a vehicle not subscribed to the G-BOOK service, perform the vehicle linking setting. (see <xref label="Seep08" href="RM000001C3S00RX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When replacing the navigation receiver assembly on a vehicle subscribed to the G-BOOK service, perform the vehicle linking setting, then perform the G-BOOK use resumption operation and HELPNET service start operation. (see <xref label="Seep09" href="RM000001C3S00RX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the navigation receiver assembly is replaced while a purchased G-SOUND unlimited license exists, perform G-SOUND license recovery. (see <xref label="Seep14" href="RM000001C3S00RX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Confirmation Test</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
<action-ci-fin>END</action-ci-fin>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
</descript-diag>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>